//   r+2+LA+DE    exp out item 0 (e0), r+3+LA+DE e1 -> den adder issue add(e0, e1) at r+3+LA+DE
//   r+3+2LA+DE   den out; div issue item 0 (e0 delayed LA+1) at that edge, item 1 next edge
